The mitmproxy e2e CA and leaf are generated at container start by
`generate_certs.py`. They are not stored in git.

- `/certs-ca/mitmproxy-ca.crt` — CA volume; Connect trusts via `SSL_CERT_FILE`
- `/certs/mitmproxy.pem` — leaf volume (mitmproxy only): SAN mitmproxy +
  mitmproxy-subdomain, plus private key for `--certs`
